# The argument that DERIVES: the claim is grounded in the generation it comes
# from (claim_from is injected from the claim row by the evaluator) as soon as
# that generation was produced from some config by some origin -- a store
# template consumed in the BODY, which the agent may never conclude.
ClaimA is grounded in a generation G1 if ClaimA comes from the generation and the generation was produced from a config C1 by an origin O1.
ClaimA contends for a generation G1 if ClaimA is grounded in the generation.
